  "instructions": [
    "1. Bring a large pot of salted water to a boil.",
    "2. Cook the dumplings according to the package instructions or until they float to the surface.",
    "3. In a pan, melt 1 tablespoon of butter over medium heat.",
    "4. Add the cured ham or bacon and cook until crispy.",
